   <item><widget class="QLabel" name="label_note"><property name="text"><string>Uses the built-in HTTP server (default port 18099). Times follow the scoreboard, including stops and resets; no countdown is calculated. Match-time tenths are discarded. A missing or invalid clock returns HTTP 503. Temporary failed readings keep the last good value, as with the bridge.</string></property><property name="wordWrap"><bool>true</bool></property></widget></item>
